          "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Harborlight Shipping API — reference</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"REST endpoints for booking container freight, tracking shipments and retrieving rate cards.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://api.harborlight.example/docs/reference\">\n<link rel=\"service-desc\" type=\"application/openapi+json\" href=\"/openapi.json\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"APIReference\",\"name\":\"Harborlight Shipping API — reference\",\"description\":\"REST endpoints for booking container freight, tracking shipments and retrieving rate cards.\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-14\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Harborlight Logistics\"},\"genre\":\"Reference\",\"url\":\"https://api.harborlight.example/docs/reference\"}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav><a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a> <a href=\"/docs/changelog\">Changelog</a> <a href=\"/status\">Status</a></nav></header>\n<main>\n<h1>Harborlight Shipping API — reference</h1>\n<p>REST endpoints for booking container freight, tracking shipments and retrieving rate cards. Every endpoint is described in the OpenAPI document; this page is generated from it.</p>\n<p>Last updated: <time itemprop=\"dateModified\" datetime=\"2026-07-14\">14 July 2026</time></p>\n<p><a href=\"/openapi.json\">Download the OpenAPI document</a></p>\n<h2>Resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>POST /v2/bookings</code> — create a booking</li>\n<li><code>GET /v2/shipments/{id}</code> — retrieve a shipment</li>\n<li><code>GET /v2/rates</code> — retrieve the current rate card</li>\n</ul>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Harborlight Logistics. Rotterdam.</p></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
